      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype",
      "description": "The broader category of racial prejudice that includes the specific stereotype of associating Black people with criminal behavior. This stereotype is used in the meme to devalue the surgeon's professional identity and to reinforce racial bias.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
